<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_I__cl_7__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may appoint, from among public officers, a Controller of Consumer Affairs and such number of Deputy Controllers of Consumer Affairs, Assistant Controllers of Consumer Affairs and other officers as may be necessary for the purposes of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
