<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A refund referred to in paragraph (1}(a) means a refund in cash of the money paid or the value of any other consideration provided, or both, as the case may require."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
