<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The obligation to refund cannot be satisfied by permitting the consumer to acquire other goods from the supplier."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
