<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where a consumer obtains goods to replace rejected goods under paragraph (1)(b), the replacement goods shall, for the purposes of this Act, be deemed to be supplied by the supplier, and the guarantees and obligations under this Act relating to the supply of goods to a consumer shall apply to the replacement goods. Assessment of damages in case of hire-purchase agreements"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
