<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47> <https://schema.org/text> "The damages that a consumer may recover for a failure of goods supplied under a hire-purchase agreement to comply with a guarantee under this Act shall be assessed, in the absence of evidence to the contrary, on the basis that the consumer will complete the purchase of the goods or would have completed the purchase if the goods had complied with the guarantee. Liability for representation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
