<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where goods assigned or procured to be assigned to the supplier by a person acting in trade (the \"dealer\") are supplied to a consumer, every representation made to the consumer by the dealer or by any person acting on the dealer's behalf in connection with, or in the course of negotiations leading to, the supply of the goods shall give the consumer—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
