<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "as against the supplier, subject to section 49, the same rights as the consumer would have had under this Act if the representation had been made by the supplier personally; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
