<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_31__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (5), the following guarantees shall be implied where goods are supplied to a consumer:"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
