<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_36> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
