<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_V__cl_38__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
