<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_125__subsec_5__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "detain every person found in the premises until the place has been searched. Search and seizure without warrant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
