<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_127__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the premises are unoccupied, the seizing officer shall whenever possible post a list of the things seized conspicuously on the premises. Power to require attendance of person acquainted with case"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
