<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_128__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_128__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If any such person refuses to attend as so required, the Assistant Controller may report such refusal to a Magistrate who shall issue a summons to secure the attendance of such person as may be required by the order made under subsection (1). Examination of person acquainted with case"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
