<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_129__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "A person making a statement under this section shall be legally bound to state the truth, whether or not such statement is made wholly or partly in answer to questions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_129__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_129> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
