<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_130__subsec_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "if made by any person before there is time to caution him, shall not be rendered inadmissible in evidence merely by reason of no such caution having been administered if it has been administered as soon as possible."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_130__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_130> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
