<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_130__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law, a person charged for an offence to which subsection (1) applies shall not be bound to answer any question relating to the case after a caution under subsection (2) has been administered to him. Forfeiture of goods, etc., seized"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
