<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XII__cl_117__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who after fourteen days fails to comply with an award made by the Tribunal commits an offence and shall on conviction be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XII__cl_117__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XII__cl_117> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
