<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XII__cl_117__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "In the case of a continuing offence, the offender shall, in addition to the penalties under subsection (1), be liable to a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit for each day or part of a day during which the offence continues after conviction. Procedure where no provision is made"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
