<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XII__cl_118> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to this Act and to any regulations, the Tribunal shall adopt such procedure as it thinks fit and proper. Want of form"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
