<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_145__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any body corporate which is convicted of an offence under this Act for which no penalty is expressly provided shall be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit, and for a second or subsequent offence to a fine not exceeding two hundred thousand ringgit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
