<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_146> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "146" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
