<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X__cl_68__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the supplier fails to comply with a request under subsection (2) within a reasonable time having regard to all the circumstances, the supplier shall be held liable for the loss or damage."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
