<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X__cl_68__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "This section shall not apply to a person in respect of any defect in agricultural produce if the only supply of the agricultural produce by the person to another person was at a time when the agricultural produce has not undergone any industrial process."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
