<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X__cl_68__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Where two or more persons are liable under this Part for the same damage, their liability shall be joint and several."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
