<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X__cl_69__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X__cl_69__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of paragraph (1)(c), loss or damage to property shall be deemed to have occurred at the earliest time at which a person with an interest in the property has knowledge of the material facts about the loss or damage."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
