<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X__cl_69__subsec_3__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "a person's knowledge includes knowledge which he may reasonably be expected to acquire—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X__cl_69__subsec_3__para_b__subpara_i> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@/~part_X__cl_69__subsec_3__para_b> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/18/eng@> .
